{"attrs":[{"key":"activity","label":"Activity group (BPPRC specificity)","short":"Activity","text":"Nematode-active = an active record against nematodes; Insect-active = an active record against an insect order and none against nematodes; no data = no specificity record for any name of the sequence","values":[{"id":"Nematode-active","label":"Nematode-active","colour":"#c51b7d","n":19},{"id":"Insect-active","label":"Insect-active","colour":"#2f8a57","n":173},{"id":"Other organism only","label":"Other organism only","colour":"#8a5cc4","n":1},{"id":"Tested, none active","label":"Tested, none active","colour":"#8a94a0","n":16},{"id":"No data","label":"No data","colour":"#b9bec4","n":461}]},{"key":"domtree","label":"Domain trees: does one domain differ?","short":"Domain trees","text":"Group (BPPRC secondary rank, e.g. Cry1B) of the 10 nearest relatives in the Domain I, II and III trees; 'Domain X differs' = the other two trees agree; not assessable = no dominant group among the nearest relatives","values":[{"id":"concordant","label":"concordant","colour":"#2f8a57","n":336},{"id":"Domain II differs","label":"Domain II differs","colour":"#3b7cbd","n":1},{"id":"Domain III differs","label":"Domain III differs","colour":"#d64045","n":8},{"id":"all three differ","label":"all three differ","colour":"#8a5cc4","n":2},{"id":"not assessable","label":"not assessable","colour":"#b9bec4","n":320},{"id":"not in all domain trees","label":"not in all domain trees","colour":"#b9bec4","n":3}]},{"key":"target","label":"Target order (BPPRC specificity)","short":"Target order","text":"Insect order (or nematodes) with most BPPRC activity records; 'none active recorded' = only negative records; 'no data' = no specificity record for any of the names","values":[{"id":"no data","label":"no data","colour":"#b9bec4","n":461},{"id":"Lepidoptera","label":"Lepidoptera","colour":"#3b7cbd","n":99},{"id":"Coleoptera","label":"Coleoptera","colour":"#2f8a57","n":40},{"id":"Diptera","label":"Diptera","colour":"#d49a14","n":32},{"id":"Nematoda (Rhabditida)","label":"Nematoda (Rhabditida)","colour":"#8a5cc4","n":18},{"id":"none active recorded","label":"none active recorded","colour":"#b9bec4","n":16},{"id":"other order","label":"other order","colour":"#c2495f","n":2},{"id":"Hemiptera","label":"Hemiptera","colour":"#8a94a0","n":2}]},{"key":"host","label":"Source organism (GenPept)","short":"Source","text":"Organism of the GenPept record; Bt serovars named in the record","values":[{"id":"Bt (no serovar stated)","label":"Bt (no serovar stated)","colour":"#d64045","n":485},{"id":"unknown","label":"unknown","colour":"#b9bec4","n":65},{"id":"Bt other serovar","label":"Bt other serovar","colour":"#2f8a57","n":50},{"id":"other species","label":"other species","colour":"#d49a14","n":31},{"id":"Bt kurstaki","label":"Bt kurstaki","colour":"#8a5cc4","n":21},{"id":"Bt aizawai","label":"Bt aizawai","colour":"#1f9d8f","n":9},{"id":"Bt entomocidus","label":"Bt entomocidus","colour":"#c2495f","n":5},{"id":"Bt israelensis","label":"Bt israelensis","colour":"#8a94a0","n":4}]},{"key":"era","label":"Year of the BPPRC entry","short":"Year","text":"Year given by BPPRC for the first name of the sequence","values":[{"id":"2006-2015","label":"2006-2015","colour":"#d64045","n":341},{"id":"1996-2005","label":"1996-2005","colour":"#3b7cbd","n":154},{"id":"to 1995","label":"to 1995","colour":"#2f8a57","n":87},{"id":"2016 or later","label":"2016 or later","colour":"#d49a14","n":85},{"id":"n/a","label":"n/a","colour":"#b9bec4","n":3}]},{"key":"size","label":"Length (protoxin or toxin only)","short":"Length","text":"Sequences of 800 residues or more carry the C-terminal protoxin half","values":[{"id":"long (>= 800 aa, protoxin)","label":"long (>= 800 aa, protoxin)","colour":"#d64045","n":408},{"id":"short (< 800 aa)","label":"short (< 800 aa)","colour":"#3b7cbd","n":262}]},{"key":"model","label":"Structure model","short":"Model","text":"Source of the models of the entry (primary model = most residues p